.translation_key = "home",
---

This locale sets `host_url_override`, which is what makes the cross-variant
`absLink()` cell in the layout meaningful: linking into it from another locale
crosses a host boundary, so `printLinkPrefix` prints a host of its own and
`absLink()` must not add a second one.
